-- code injectivity: a component equation extracted from a composite
-- hypothesis (Foundation's →-inj-𝕌)
def useInj : (a : 𝕌) (b : 𝕌) (h : (a → 𝟙) ≡ (b → 𝟙) ∈ 𝕌) (x : a) → b ≔ λa. λb. λh. λx. x
-- and through (El-inj is the type-level route the elaborator takes)
def useInjPair : (a : 𝕌) (b : 𝕌) (c : 𝕌) (h : (a ⨯ c) ≡ (b ⨯ c) ∈ 𝕌) (x : a) → b ≔ λa. λb. λc. λh. λx. x
